    "dc.description.abstract" : [ {
      "value" : "Summary of Repealing and Amendment Act, 2023 \n*The Repealing and Amending Act, 2023 repeals a total of 72 enactments across various domains. *Amends one enactment, The Factoring Regulation Act, 2011, with a minor textual correction. *Saves all previous actions, rights, and proceedings under the repealed acts.",
